{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33880","headline":"秋晚留题鲁望郊居二首 一 · 皮日休","name":"秋晚留题鲁望郊居二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹树冷濩落，入门神已清。\n寒蛩傍枕响，秋菜上墙生。\n黄犬病仍吠，白驴饥不鸣。\n唯将一杯酒，尽日慰刘桢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}